{"id":"5cd9c13a-80ae-47ad-a9a5-afdbb16ab701","doi":"10.3724/sp.j.1042.2026.2109","pmid":null,"openalexId":null,"title":"潜变量建模视角下属性层级结构的检验与估计","titleZh":null,"abstract":"属性层级结构(Attribute Hierarchical Structure, AHS)刻画了属性之间的先决关系, 在测验设计、教学设计与评估、学习路径规划和个性化学习推荐方面具有重要意义。基于潜变量建模方式, 结合假设检验、贝叶斯结构学习和参数估计视角, 本文系统梳理了AHS的估计和检验方法, 分析了各类方法的基本思想、内在联系及差异、优势与不足, 总结了其发展脉络与趋势, 并提出了实践中方法选择的参考建议。本研究进一步从优化方法的关键要素、丰富实验条件、拓展应用场景, 以及创新研究思路等方面提出了未来的研究方向。","summaryZh":null,"authors":["毛秀珍","黄林超","徐丙慧","郑巧玉"],"rankingStatus":"unmatched","materialLevel":"abstract","publishedAt":null,"publicationDatePrecision":"day","discoveredAt":"2026-10-28T08:17:44.075Z","relevance":"psychology","topics":["development"],"retracted":false,"isUpdateNotice":false,"workType":null,"isResearchEvidence":true,"evidenceExclusionReason":null,"baseline":false,"fulltextLicense":null,"analysis":null,"revision":1,"analysisRevision":null,"url":"https://doi.org/10.3724/sp.j.1042.2026.2109","fulltextUrl":null,"fulltext":null,"teamKeys":[],"rankingCandidates":[],"journal":{"name":"心理科学进展","issns":["1671-3710"],"division":null,"rankingYear":null,"id":null},"sources":[{"source":"official-toc","fetchedAt":"2026-11-05T22:00:48.117448+00:00","sourceId":"","url":"https://journal.psych.ac.cn/xlkxjz/CN/10.3724/SP.J.1042.2026.2109"}],"publicationUpdates":[]}